NotesStoreLane red run
======================
The lane's tests (TestFork_*, TestNote{Scopes,Snapshots,Inventory}_*) run one by one (go test -c; test binary per test)
against a scratch copy of the package in which the entry points of note_scopes.go, note_snapshots.go,
note_inventory.go, note_provenance.go, note_evidence.go, note_store.go (notesStore.get/recovery) and
note_discovery.go (noteDiscovery.list) are replaced by panic("unported: <name>"). The implementation in the worktree
was written before the tests were run, so this red is a stubbed scratch copy, not a prior commit. Pass = the test
holds without that code (pure helper tests).

